			"notes": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at 0.1.0+1.21.11 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Other Changes\n* Feat: Added prefix command. by @KMatias123 in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/199\n* Feat: KillAura DPS calculation by @KMatias123 in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/200\n* Fix: CollectionSettings mapping stringified values instead of converting the collection to a tree by @emyfops in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/204\n* Fix: Transparency for block colors in blockesp by @KMatias123 in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/208\n* Feature: AntiSpam module by @emyfops in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/202\n* Feat: ChatTimestamp, CustomChat, FancyChat, FriendHighlight by @emyfops in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/215\n* Improvement: Container utils by @beanbag44 in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/218\n* Improvement: Bind listeners by @beanbag44 in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/219\n* Half slabs don't exist in Minecraft by @Jalvaviel in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/223\n* Ref: Mixin cleanup by @emyfops in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/228\n* FIX: Prevents betterfirework from trying to start flying without an elytra or a firework. Shows a warning message to the user instead. by @KMatias123 in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/227\n* Added Rotation.kt to Hud and Yaw locking in ElytraFly.kt by @Jalvaviel in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/224\n* Improvement: Use a sequence in the build task for sim result handling by @beanbag44 in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/232\n* Add MSA launch arguemnts to README.md by @IceTank in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/245\n* Improvement: Renders by @beanbag44 in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/230\n* Improvement: rotation compatibility with other clients by @beanbag44 in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/239\n* feat(AutoWalk): Add basic AutoWalk module by @IceTank in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/238\n* Feature: Mutable module priority  by @beanbag44 in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/220\n* feat(AutoSign): Add AutoSign Module by @IceTank in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/236\n* Feat: Add auto updater module by @THCFree in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/233\n* Feat: option to view biome name in Coordinates.kt (HUD elem) by @TwinkNet in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/264\n* Fix ContainerPreview showing empty tooltip when MapPreview is enabled (issue #252) by @IceTank in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/265\n\n## New Contributors\n* @KMatias123 made their first contribution in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/199\n* @Jalvaviel made their first contribution in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/223\n* @THCFree made their first contribution in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/233\n* @TwinkNet made their first contribution in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/264\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/compare/0.0.2+1.21.5...0.1.0+1.21.11"
