			"notes": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at 0.0.2+1.21.5 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Other Changes\n* fix(Velocity): change cancellation statement and use correct listener by @cattyngmd in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/181\n* fix: incorrect rounding with imgui sliders by @cattyngmd in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/188\n* improvement(AutoTotem): move cursor item before swap by @cattyngmd in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/187\n* Improvement: Hide warnings from managers unless enabled by @beanbag44 in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/186\n* feat: add more hud settings by @cattyngmd in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/192\n* fix(PlayerTrap): account epsilon when calculating player hitbox size by @cattyngmd in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/193\n* Ref: Removed shader language, correct floating origin in shaders and other fixes by @emyfops in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/184\n\n## New Contributors\n* @cattyngmd made their first contribution in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/181\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/compare/0.0.1+1.21.5...0.0.2+1.21.5"
