			"notes": "We are incredibly proud to announce the release of the all-new **Lambda Client**, a free, open-source utility mod completely rewritten from the ground up for **Minecraft 1.21.5**.\n\nThis is not just an update; it is a new beginning. After over two years of development, we have rebuilt the client to focus on advanced automation, unmatched performance, and complex task execution with minimal micromanagement.\n\n**:inbox_tray: Download & Links**\n* **Website:** http://lambda-client.org/\n* **Repository:** https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda\n\n**:sparkles: Key Features & Changes**\n* **Automation Engine:** Features a full build engine with Litematica integration, conflict-free orchestration, and complex block state handling (rotations, attachments, etc.).\n* **New GUI:** A sophisticated interface built on **Dear ImGui** offering fine-grained control over 1000+ settings.\n* **Elytra Boost:** Now capable of speeds up to **200 km/h**.\n\n**:warning: Important Notices**\n1.  **2B2T / Grim Anticheat:** 2B2T has changed their Grim config as of today. While Lambda is \"Anticheat Ready\", some features may require a rework or exhibit instability due to this sudden server-side change.\n2.  **Legacy Client:** The previous version of the client has been renamed to **Lambda Legacy**. It has been archived and moved to: https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda-legacy. Old addons are **not** compatible with the new Lambda.\n3.  **Alpha Status:** This is an **Alpha** release. While highly capable, please expect bugs and incomplete features as we progress toward Beta.\n\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at 0.0.1+1.21.5 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Bug Fixes\n* [1.20.4] [All] Bug: FakePlayer not showing skin  by @emyfops in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/64\n* [1.20.4] [All] Bug: Hotkeys not muted while inputting in GUI by @emyfops in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/65\n* [1.20.4] [All] Bug: Inconsistent run in dev environment by @emyfops in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/70\n* [1.20.4] [All] Bug: Logo not found even if it was found by @emyfops in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/92\n### New Features\n* [1.20.4] Feat: HUD, docking, jesus, particles etc by @Avanatiker in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/49\n* [1.20.x] [All] Feat: Added elytra flight mode boost by @Camii2407 in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/50\n* [1.20.4] Feat: Skybox and fog colors by @Camii2407 in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/60\n* [1.20.4] Feat: Fast vector by @emyfops in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/46\n* [1.20.4] Feat: Sky colors by @emyfops in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/72\n* [1.20.4] Feat: Scaffold by @Avanatiker in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/73\n* [1.20.x] Feat: Elytra flight rocket boost by @Camii2407 in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/75\n* [1.20.4] Feat: Common buffer interface by @emyfops in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/80\n* [1.20.4] Feat: Click Friend by @emyfops in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/88\n* [1.20.4] Feat: StorageESP by @emyfops in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/94\n* [Feature] Fixed rate tick by @Avanatiker in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/100\n* [1.20.4] Feat: Dynamic class remapping by @emyfops in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/117\n* Bring back default keybind for ClickGUI by @mmvanheusden in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/123\n* Feature: ViewModel module by @beanbag44 in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/128\n* Feature: Menu Bar, improved GUI layout and QuickSearch by @Avanatiker in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/140\n* Feature: Manager Loggers by @beanbag44 in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/146\n* Feature: AutoEat and Building Life Maintainance by @Avanatiker in https://github.com/lambda-client/lambda/pull/147\n\n..."
